Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,会有一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}be a point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们死了怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if we are dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.17,0:12:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我本来在两天内要被处决 - 我本来在打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was gonna be executed in two days. - And I was in combat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.92,0:12:56.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次我看到你不需要降落伞就到达那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I looked you didn't need a parachute to get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不管发生了什么事 或是为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it doesn't matter what happened, or why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:12.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的问题就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only question is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么走出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we get out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:23.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去高地 - 我们不能走散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- To high ground. - We need to stick together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.72,0:13:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你们就该跟着我走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you should follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.44,0:14:06.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要碰它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I wouldn't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辽宁古果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Archaefructus liaoningensis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.59,0:14:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,含有剧毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is really, really poisonous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:27.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轻轻一碰 就会导致全身麻痹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't take more than one scratch, cause total paralysis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.40,0:14:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会保护你离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will watch for you out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你交了个兄弟啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You made a buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.96,0:14:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得休息一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.92,0:14:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就休息啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:15:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来也累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like you could use it too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.06,0:15:09.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.84,0:15:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 你想要做童子军小队长? 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. You want to play scout leader? Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你要跟着我? 行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you gonna follow me? Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不会做这个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm not doing this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是独自一人的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm better on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.57,0:15:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要看真格的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to see something fucked up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那个和太阳之间...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, between that and the sun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.99,0:15:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们真的有问题了 - 那太阳呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'd say we have a real problem. - What about the sun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自从我们到了这儿 就没见太阳动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hasn't moved since we got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.72,0:16:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得到底会发生什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think is really going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.98,0:16:11.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.00,0:16:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,反恐特种部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spetznatz alpha group,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洛泽塔斯(墨西哥最大的犯罪集团) 联合企业杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Los Zetas cartel enforcer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.87,0:16:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,革命联合阵线 来自塞拉利昂的行刑队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R.U.F. that's a death squad from Sierra Leone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杀手山口组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yakuza in the Dawokei,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国联邦调查局最想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the F.B.I.'s most wanted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有...他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是重量级人物 他不属于...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all heavy-hitters, he doesn't belong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不属于什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belong to what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.49,0:16:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的是我们被选中了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'd say we were chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:05.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道丛林 所有选手...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the jungle, all the players...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:11.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你以前是军队的 从事机密工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm guessing ex-military, black-ops,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可能是个雇佣兵 - 你对此有问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Probably a mercenary. - You got a problem with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:21.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此刻没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at the moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.40,0:19:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么东西曾降落到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something was dropped here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.76,0:19:11.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same as us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.63,0:19:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not the same as us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过我们是被选中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said we were chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:29.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被选中干吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chosen for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.83,0:20:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走路小心点 头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good there, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心 快闪开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Step!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 12点钟方向 110米处 - 搞定他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 12 o'clock. 110 meters. - Take him! Take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.80,0:21:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.36,0:21:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们触发了一个死人设的机关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We triggered a dead man's trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.57,0:21:50.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从腐烂程度判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.49,0:21:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经死亡两个礼拜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Judging from the rate of decomposition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:56.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他占据适当位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took up a position here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.60,0:22:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里可以扫射所有方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shooting in all directions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.74,0:22:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是最后抵抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was a last stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美国特种兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}United States special forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.39,0:22:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.84,0:22:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他本该被部署于阿富汗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's supposed to be deployed in Afghanistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.46,0:22:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么会在这里给我们设机关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing here setting traps for us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.06,0:22:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些不是针对我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't meant for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在追捕其它什么东西...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was hunting something else...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.72,0:22:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 某些更大的东西 - 更大?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Something a lot bigger. - Bigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.18,0:22:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,树干是一种陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trunk was a dead-fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.15,0:22:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,概测法加上陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rule of thumb with a dead-fall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.47,0:22:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是你设定的目标动物翻5倍重量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you set the weight five times that of the target animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.70,0:22:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管它是什么 它进入陷阱触发绊线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it was, it got through the trip-wires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就会一触即发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And did this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:53.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.86,0:23:19.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.68,0:23:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.56,0:24:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要订个新计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna need a new plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.15,0:25:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.03,0:25:24.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然进得来 就一定出得去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone put us on this rock, there's gotta be a way off it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! What the fuck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.98,0:25:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操蛋的小匕首\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you know what? Fuck this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.64,0:25:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个狗屁小匕首 伙计 我要枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit, man. I want a gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老兄 快给我 你他妈的有两把枪啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come man. You got two mother fucking guns, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.46,0:25:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人给我一把枪吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody give me a gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.06,0:25:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快给我啊 俄国佬 你他妈的有把大枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Russian, you got a big fucking gun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 老兄 给我把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on man, give me a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.98,0:25:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我把枪 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a gun, right now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.70,0:26:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.92,0:26:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早已做好死亡准备了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ready to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.90,0:26:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.33,0:27:36.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.39,0:28:12.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.39,0:28:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小心点 头儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good there, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快跑...快爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Run! Come on! Climb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.19,0:28:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.29,0:29:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你一样坏...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As bad as you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.59,0:29:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西更糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those things are worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.85,0:30:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们一个没少 它们刚...怎么 离开了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since we still eight, they just...what? Left?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.27,0:30:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.78,0:30:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是哨音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whistle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.22,0:30:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们被召唤回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.14,0:30:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright. Listen up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家数一下子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody do a shell count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.31,0:30:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要保存弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to conserve ammunition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.71,0:30:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重新装入弹药 马上装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reload. Do it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.13,0:30:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, I'm...just what the hell is going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.07,0:30:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在被追捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're being hunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.65,0:30:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,笼子 士兵 我们所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cages, soldier, all of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.94,0:30:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都是因同一个目的被带到这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All brought here for the same purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.56,0:30:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个星球是个野生动物保护区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This planet is a game preserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.40,0:30:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我们就是那些野生动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.38,0:30:55.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一你没注意到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case you didn't notice,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.62,0:30:57.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚就被驱赶出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we just got flushed out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.10,0:31:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们放狗进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sent the dogs in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.05,0:31:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像如果你在追踪野猪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like you would if you were stalking boar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.82,0:31:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪以示警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shooting quail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.86,0:31:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我们分开 然后暗中观看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They split us apart, and they watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.77,0:31:11.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,测试我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Testing us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.09,0:31:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道所有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.43,0:31:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.73,0:31:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我以前所作的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what I would do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.44,0:31:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妙极了 - 等等...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fantastic. - Wait...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.48,0:31:38.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们只有7个人 - 救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There are only seven of us. - Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.41,0:32:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.21,0:32:23.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 等等... - 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait... - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.44,0:32:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.05,0:32:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.99,0:32:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.03,0:32:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.46,0:33:03.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使一个人受伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wound one man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.83,0:33:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使他受罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.36,0:33:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使他流血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.04,0:33:15.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使他发出呼救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make him call out for help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.75,0:33:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后设陷阱 杀死来救他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And set a trap, and kill those who come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:26.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 因为我曾干过这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, because I have done this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.83,0:33:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要把他留在这儿 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're gonna leave him here, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.50,0:33:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧 看看他 他已经玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, look at him. He's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.78,0:33:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没别的可做的了 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing...there's nothing else we can do, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.44,0:33:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.69,0:33:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别管他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We leave him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.89,0:33:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你来解决吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then that's on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.52,0:34:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.22,0:34:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救我 救我 是个陷阱 是个陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me. Help me. It's a trap. It's a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.84,0:35:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.01,0:35:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去更高处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go to higher ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.33,0:35:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.14,0:35:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们被困在一个外星人的捕猎星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trapped on an alien hunting planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.10,0:35:29.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的认为解决的办法是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you really think the solution is to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.14,0:35:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行走?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}walk over?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.67,0:35:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它想我们跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wants us to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.64,0:35:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才是猎捕的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how it hunts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.50,0:35:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是它的丛林\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is its jungle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.50,0:35:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.60,0:35:52.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它的规则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跑...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We run...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.73,0:36:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.44,0:36:04.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有别的选择了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the alternative?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.58,0:36:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要知道我们在对付的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to know what we're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.68,0:36:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗朝这个方向跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dog tracks go that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.42,0:36:16.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们跟着它走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go after it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.97,0:36:35.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No movement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.38,0:37:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来 我们并不是唯一被追捕的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like, we're not the only things been hunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.99,0:39:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.85,0:39:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他妈是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.78,0:39:53.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是个错误 我们必须离开 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a mistake.We have to leave. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.92,0:39:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个硬汉哪儿去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the tough guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.01,0:40:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他离开我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.74,0:40:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.70,0:41:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑 跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.57,0:41:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跑 跑 跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run! Run! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.95,0:43:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你设计我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You set us up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.65,0:43:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他让我们进那个死亡集中营的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He led us into that death camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.12,0:43:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后藏起来等着那个东西来袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then hid and waited for that thing to strike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.50,0:43:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.71,0:43:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得知道我们在对付的是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed to know who we're up against.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.63,0:43:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在我来 - 有个人就因此而死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now I do. - A man is dead because of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.40,0:43:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上你就准备杀了他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This morning you were ready to kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.47,0:43:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这他妈跟今天早晨没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it ain't this god damn morning, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.35,0:43:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 至少他不是白死的 - 为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well at least he didn't die in vain. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.95,0:43:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好让我们可以第一时间发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we could find out first-hand,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.39,0:43:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那种我们被人扁的感觉怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what it feels like to have our asses kicked?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.04,0:43:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我们发现它们不止一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we found out that there's more than one of them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.71,0:43:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们用的是自动推进式武器和能量武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they use projectile and energy based weapons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.49,0:43:40.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有某种隐形装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they have some sort of cloaking device,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.90,0:43:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们比我们大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they're bigger than us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.81,0:43:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比我们结实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.61,0:43:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也比我们沉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But also heavier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.79,0:43:50.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为了自己拿我们去冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've put us at risk for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.28,0:43:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要孤军奋战吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you wanna be in your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.05,0:43:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.64,0:43:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不跟他们说实话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you tell them the true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.37,0:43:59.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道你在说什么... - 你很清楚我在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know what you're talking... - You know what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.94,0:44:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看那个东西的眼神格外紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way you looked to that thing, that was strung up.{\r}
