Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.29,1:22:43.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你带我去那艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take me to the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.81,1:22:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.58,1:22:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白我的意思 对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand me, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.20,1:23:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.87,1:23:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 天啊 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God.  - I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.55,1:23:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没死呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're not dead yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.15,1:23:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.23,1:27:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess he made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.06,1:27:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能再来一遍的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we can do it over again,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.04,1:27:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还会做一样的选择吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you make the same choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.06,1:27:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.47,1:28:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.31,1:28:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果时光重来的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the time comes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.57,1:28:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会两者都选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll choose both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.75,1:28:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你保证会很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise you it will be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.24,1:28:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.51,1:28:21.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.26,1:28:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是一种神经毒素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a neurotoxin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.06,1:28:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这儿面临这么多选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So many to choose from around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.29,1:28:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是别担心 它不会致命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But don't worry. It's not fatal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.18,1:28:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是体验一下...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be able to experience...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.50,1:28:56.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.03,1:29:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想现在你知道 他们为什么选择我了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess now you realize why they chose me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.61,1:29:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的时间永远都在你们之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in front of you guys the whole time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.80,1:29:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看着你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.00,1:29:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聆听你们的信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earning your trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.96,1:29:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看不到真实的我是什么样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't see me for what I really am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.95,1:29:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看 回到家里..\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, back home...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.26,1:29:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个杀人犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a murderer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.63,1:29:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个变态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.41,1:30:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But here,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.70,1:30:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有的怪物聚在一起...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}among the monsters...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.56,1:30:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个正常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.57,1:30:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢在这的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.31,1:30:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.51,1:30:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you came back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.59,1:30:42.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我错过了那班车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I missed my ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.40,1:30:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 快帮我们从这儿出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank God. Help us get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.29,1:31:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她瘫痪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's paralyzed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.03,1:31:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能它们给了她什么东西 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they gave her something, I don't know what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.57,1:31:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是让她瘫痪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it paralyzed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.72,1:31:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.60,1:31:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太忙了 都没怎么在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so busy, you didn't care about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.75,1:31:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要照顾好你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got to look out for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.37,1:31:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要从这儿出去了 抓紧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting out of here, just stay in tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.70,1:31:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我不觉得你会回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I didn't think you'd come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.22,1:31:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是她...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.34,1:31:57.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她从来没有不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she never lost faith on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:57.39,1:32:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我欠你一个道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I owe you an apology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.68,1:32:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你终究是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a good man after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.45,1:32:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.61,1:32:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.37,1:32:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我很快就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.55,1:32:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.05,1:32:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 不要杀我 求你 不要杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't kill me! Please, don't kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.73,1:32:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.14,1:33:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.80,1:34:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你们的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm one of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.83,1:34:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点 下手啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on! Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.43,1:34:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿呢 杀了我 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here, kill me! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.32,1:34:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 现在就下手 杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Do it now! Kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.66,1:36:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.73,1:38:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了它吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you kill it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.80,1:38:59.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.16,1:39:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是罗伊斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Royce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.83,1:39:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你 罗伊斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to meet you, Royce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.47,1:39:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是伊莎贝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Isabelle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.89,1:40:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.13,1:40:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们想个办法离开这鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find a way off this fucking planet.{\r}
